-- Mode: new pricelist (clinic had 0 services and 0 lab tests locally and on prod, checked 2026-10-02 and 2026-10-06).
-- Sources (scans without a text layer):
--   1) https://www.kccg.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Cjenovnik-2019.pdf
--      «CJENOVNIK ZA TREĆA LICA KCCG-a», broj 03/01-12050/1 (handwritten), 20.05.2019, «Podgorica, maj 2019»;
--      78 pages: ambulante pp. 3–59, stacionar DRG pp. 60–78. HTTP Last-Modified 2026-08-20.
--      snapshot: data/clinic-pricelists/sources/klinicki-centar-crne-gore-podgorica/2026-10-02-cjenovnik-2019.pdf
--   2) https://www.kccg.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Cjenovnik-izmjene-i-dopune-2025.pdf
--      Odluka Odbora direktora br. 03/01-21069/3-1, 01.08.2025 (Ministry of Health consent 18.08.2025), 27 pages:
--      DRG pp. 3–23 (coefficient value 1.900,45), specialist examinations pp. 24–27 (124 codes).
--      snapshot: …/2026-10-02-izmjene-i-dopune-2025.pdf
-- Effective price: ambulante = 2019 price, overridden by code with the 2025 amendments; stacionar = DRG 2025
--   (coefficient × 1.900,45; 698 groups, the 2019 DRG table is fully replaced). Ambulante and DRG codes do not collide.
-- OCR: PaddleOCR + independent page-by-page LLM transcription; 2214 of 2274 2019 codes agreed to the cent,
--   the rest settled by cross-check (Danilo pricelist / 3 × FZOCG) or by reading the scan (manual-fixes.json).
-- Price check: the 2019 price = 3.0 × FZOCG price_ambulanta_eur (or 3.0 × odjeljenje where there is no
--   outpatient price) for ~1900 codes; = Danilo (clinic 88) price for ~1450 codes.
-- is_price_outdated = 0 everywhere: KCCG republished the 2019 pricelist in 2026-08 next to the 2025 amendments as the current act.
-- DRG: procedural groups → the procedure record (variants of severity → price range); other groups → one
--   hospitalization-for-* record per code (convention of the Mojkovac import, its 24 records reused by code).
--   Where KCCG also has an ambulatory price for the same procedure, the DRG gets its own hospitalization record.
-- Several codes on one catalog entry: code = codes joined with «/», price = min, price_max = max.
-- Summary: 2199 services (832 new catalog records), 658 lab tests (131 new),
--   8 codes not imported (unit prices, B2B, DRG 960Z/961Z/963Z with price 0, D25019) — see the import record.
-- Record: data/clinic-imports/klinicki-centar-crne-gore-podgorica.json, working files: data/clinic-services-import/kccg/
-- Idempotent: catalog INSERT … ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE name_en = name_en, prices/relations INSERT IGNORE.

SET @clinic_id = (SELECT id FROM clinics WHERE slug = 'klinicki-centar-crne-gore-podgorica');

